==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|skiūta}}, from {{der|sv|non|skjóta}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*skeutaną}}, from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*(s)kewd-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/²ɧʉːta/}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-skjuta.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|sv|²ʉːta|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{sv-verb-irr|skjuter|sköt|skjutit|skjut}}

# to [[shoot]] (a weapon)
#: {{synonyms|sv|avfyra}}
#: {{ux|sv|Det är inte bara att '''skjuta''', du måste träffa också.|You can't just '''shoot''', you have to hit too.}}
# to [[shoot]] (hit with a projectile from a weapon)
#: {{ux|sv|Han blev '''skjuten''' i armen.|He was '''shot''' in the arm.}}
# {{lb|sv|sports}} to [[shoot]], to [[fire]] (a ball, puck, or the like, with force)
#: {{ux|sv|Han '''sköt''' bollen i mål!|He '''shot''' the ball into the goal!}}
# to [[push]], to [[shove]] (something, moving it)
#: {{ux|sv|Hon '''sköt''' lådan framför sig.|She '''pushed''' the box in front of her.}}
# {{lb|sv|usually with {{m|sv|på}}}} to [[push back]], to [[postpone]] (move to later)
#: {{synonyms|sv|senarelägga}}
#: {{ux|sv|Jag tycker vi '''skjuter''' på schemat 30 minuter.|I think we should '''push''' the schedule '''back''' by 30 minutes.}}
# to [[protrude]], to [[extend]]
#: {{syn|sv|sticka ut}}
#: {{ux|sv|Hon snubblade på en gren som '''sköt ut''' från buskaget.|She tripped on a branch that '''was protruding''' from the bushes.}}
# [[skyrocket]], to [[increase]] with [[accelerating]] [[speed]]
#: {{syn|sv|skena|rusa}}
#: {{ux|sv|Börsen '''sköt''' i höjden.|The stockmarket '''skyrocket'''.|lit=The stockmarket '''shoot''' into the sky/height.}}
# {{lb|sv|colloquial}} to [[scan]] a [[barcode]] or similar
#: {{synonyms|sv|[[skanna]], [[läsa]] av}}
#: {{ux|sv|Glöm inte att '''skjuta''' mjölken.|Don't forget to '''scan''' the milk.}}
# {{lb|sv|slang}} [[inject]] oneself with a [[syringe]] (often illegal [[narcotics]])
#: {{syn|sv|injicera}}
#: {{ux|sv|En väktare såg henne '''skjuta''' heroin.|A security guard saw her '''shooting up''' heroin.}}

